{
  "answer": "Since your medium-haul flight arrived 2 hours 50 minutes late due to a technical problem, which is within Corvina's control, you are eligible for compensation of EUR 350. This is because the arrival delay was 3 hours or more, and technical faults are considered within Corvina's control. Please note that if the delay was caused by an extraordinary circumstance (such as severe weather, air traffic control restrictions, or strikes), compensation would not apply, but care services would still be provided. In your case, as the delay was due to a technical problem, compensation applies. You can claim this within 12 months of the flight date through the online form, and the payment will be made by bank transfer or as a travel voucher within 30 days of your claim submission.",
  "policy_covers_question": true
}
